WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.091
Two questions everyone asks first: how fast can you start, and what does it cost? Fair. Here's the honest answer.

00:07.091 --> 00:17.483
We start with a one-week audit. Fixed scope, fixed price, and you leave with a plan whether or not we end up working together. No big commitment just to find out if I can help.

00:17.483 --> 00:26.574
From there, the work is scoped in sprints — you see a working result each week, and you can stop whenever. No open-ended retainer, no surprise invoices.

00:26.574 --> 00:30.650
You know the cost before you commit, and you own everything I build.

00:30.650 --> 00:34.115
Start small, see it work, then decide. Book the audit.

